cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "AbsorptionCutoff: a Lean 4 formalization of absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical systems"
version: 1.1.0
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of absorption cutoff and
  stationary singularities for Gaussian random dynamical systems with
  coordinatewise tanh nonlinearity and nearest-grid rounding. The production
  library contains no sorry and declares no custom axiom. Its seven audited
  declarations -- the six paper-facing results and a focused
  fixed-dimensional-absorption alias -- are additionally checked by
  leanprover/comparator against restatements written in Mathlib vocabulary only.
type: software
